== campfire ==

= companion
# speaker: Bramble
# font: cartridge
Sit, sit! The fire's warm and I have been saving one perfectly good thought for exactly this moment.
~ start_cutscene("campfire-stargazer")
-> DONE

= open
# speaker: Bramble
# font: cartridge
I once tried to count every ember in a fire. Got to four hundred and something before one of them winked at me. Rude, honestly.
-> DONE

= reply
# speaker: You
# font: comicoro
Embers don't wink, Bramble.
-> DONE

= stars
# speaker: Bramble
# font: cartridge
No, but the stars do. See that smear up there? That's the Great Soup Ladle. And that bright one, low and stubborn - that's Gerald.
-> DONE

= wish
# speaker: You
# font: comicoro
...You named a star Gerald.
-> DONE

= memory
# speaker: Bramble
# font: cartridge
Gerald has been extremely reliable, unlike certain constellations I could name. My gran swore that if you whisper a secret to Gerald, he keeps it a thousand years and never once gossips.
-> DONE

= quiet
# speaker: You
# font: comicoro
Then I'll save mine for him.
-> DONE

= goodnight
# speaker: Bramble
# font: cartridge
Good. He likes the quiet ones best. Sleep now, wanderer - Gerald's got the watch, and I've got the fire.
-> DONE
